#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:10
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "行為"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:14
msgid ""
"Important: turn off KDE's own edge snapping, or both will show. System Settings > Screen Edges: turn off \"Maximize: Drag windows to top edge\" and \"Tile: Drag windows to the left or right edge\"."
msgstr ""
"重要：請關閉 KDE 內建的螢幕邊緣貼齊，否則兩者的預覽都會顯示。在「系統設定 > 螢幕邊緣」中，關閉「最大化：將視窗拖曳到頂部邊緣」和「並排：將視窗拖曳到左側或右側邊緣」。"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:23
msgid "Snap Assist after edge snapping"
msgstr "邊緣貼齊後顯示 Snap Assist"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:27
msgid "Drag a window to the left or right screen edge. The other windows then show up as thumbnails in the free half."
msgstr "將視窗拖曳到螢幕左側或右側邊緣，其他視窗會以縮圖顯示在空出的另一半螢幕中。"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:36
msgid "Edge snapping"
msgstr "邊緣貼齊"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:40
msgid "Snap11 snaps windows dragged to the left or right screen edge itself, with its own outline. For that, turn off KDE's own edge tiling (System Settings > Screen Edges), or both will show."
msgstr "Snap11 會使用自己的外框，將拖曳到螢幕左側或右側邊緣的視窗貼齊定位。請關閉 KDE 內建的邊緣並排（系統設定 > 螢幕邊緣），否則兩者的預覽都會顯示。"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:48
msgid "Snap at the outer screen edges"
msgstr "貼齊螢幕外側邊緣"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:53
msgid "Snap at the edges between monitors"
msgstr "貼齊顯示器之間的邊緣"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:58
msgid "Snap to a quarter near the corners"
msgstr "在角落附近貼齊為螢幕的四分之一"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:63
msgid "Next to a snapped window, fill the space that is left"
msgstr "填滿已貼齊視窗旁的剩餘空間"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:68
msgid "Snap zone width:"
msgstr "貼齊區域寬度："

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:75
msgid " px"
msgstr " px"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:80
msgid "Restore a window's size when you drag it out of a snap"
msgstr "將視窗拖離貼齊位置時還原其大小"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:91
msgid "Snap layout bar at the top edge"
msgstr "頂部邊緣的貼齊版面配置列"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:95
msgid "Like Windows 11: when you drag a window, a small bar slides in at the top of the screen. Drag the window onto it to see the layouts, and drop it on the zone where it should go."
msgstr "與 Windows 11 類似：拖曳視窗時，螢幕頂部會滑入一個小工具列。將視窗拖到該工具列上即可檢視版面配置，再放到目標區域。"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:103
msgid "50 / 50"
msgstr "50 / 50"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:108
msgid "66 / 33"
msgstr "66 / 33"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:113
msgid "33 / 33 / 33"
msgstr "33 / 33 / 33"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:118
msgid "50 + two quarters"
msgstr "50 + 兩個四分之一區域"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:123
msgid "Quarters"
msgstr "四分之一區域"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:128
msgid "25 / 50 / 25"
msgstr "25 / 50 / 25"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:133
msgid "33 / 66 (not in Windows)"
msgstr "33 / 66（Windows 沒有此配置）"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:138
msgid "Three-column layouts only on wide screens (1920 px and up), like Windows"
msgstr "與 Windows 一樣，僅在寬螢幕（1920 px 以上）使用三欄配置"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:143
msgid "Offer windows for the other zones afterwards"
msgstr "接著為其他區域提供可選視窗"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:148
msgid "Use KDE's tiles, so windows share resize borders (replaces the tile editor's layout on that screen)"
msgstr "使用 KDE 並排，讓視窗共用調整大小的邊界（取代該螢幕上並排編輯器的配置）"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:158
msgid "Top edge"
msgstr "頂部邊緣"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:164
msgid "Maximize when dropped at the top edge"
msgstr "放到頂部邊緣時最大化"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:169
msgid "Trigger distance from the top edge:"
msgstr "距頂部邊緣的觸發距離："

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:186
msgid "Window picker"
msgstr "視窗選擇器"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:192
msgid "Include minimized windows"
msgstr "包含已最小化的視窗"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:197
msgid "Only windows from the same screen"
msgstr "僅顯示同一螢幕上的視窗"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:213
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "外觀"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:217
msgid "Sizes"
msgstr "大小"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:221
msgid "Snap11 looks like Windows 11. Light or dark and the accent color follow your system settings, like in Windows."
msgstr "Snap11 的外觀與 Windows 11 相似。淺色或深色模式及強調色會像 Windows 一樣跟隨系統設定。"

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:229
msgid "Layout width in the snap bar:"
msgstr "貼齊列中的版面配置寬度："

#: miryu-snap11/contents/ui/config.ui:241
msgid "Maximum thumbnail width in Snap Assist:"
msgstr "Snap Assist 中縮圖的最大寬度："
